EN:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Bugs come in all shapes and sizes.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It's really fun just to observe them!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Coming here was worth the trip.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}¡Hay tantos tipos de bichos!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Me gusta mucho ver lo que tienen
en común y lo que los distingue.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ci sono insetti di tutte le forme e
dimensioni.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Io adoooro osservarli!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Che meraviglia questo posto!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Böceklerin her boyu, her şekli var.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sadece izlemek bile çok eğlenceli!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Buraya kadar gelmeye değdi.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'm going from town to town to see
all the bugs I've been reading about{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
in their natural habitats.
